  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between tests in two studies (Losovskaya 2014 and 2016), with random-effects pooled estimates: Diaskintest vs. IGRA 87.16% (79.47–92.24), Diaskintest vs. TST 5mm 55.45% (46.08–64.45) and IGRA vs. TST 5mm 51.38% (42.05–60.60). Agreement is much higher between Diaskintest and IGRA than between either test and TST.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين الاختبارات في دراستين (Losovskaya 2014 و2016)، مع تقديرات مجمّعة بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية: Diaskintest مقابل IGRA 87.16% (79.47–92.24)، وDiaskintest مقابل TST 5 مم 55.45% (46.08–64.45)، وIGRA مقابل TST 5 مم 51.38% (42.05–60.60). والتوافق بين Diaskintest وIGRA أعلى بكثير منه بين أيٍّ منهما وTST.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示两项研究（Losovskaya 2014和2016）中检测之间的一致率（%），以及随机效应合并估计值：Diaskintest对IGRA为87.16%（79.47–92.24），Diaskintest对TST 5mm为55.45%（46.08–64.45），IGRA对TST 5mm为51.38%（42.05–60.60）。Diaskintest与IGRA之间的一致性远高于二者与TST之间的一致性。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de bosque de la concordancia porcentual entre pruebas en dos estudios (Losovskaya 2014 y 2016), con estimaciones combinadas por modelo de efectos aleatorios: Diaskintest frente a IGRA 87,16% (79,47–92,24), Diaskintest frente a TST 5 mm 55,45% (46,08–64,45) e IGRA frente a TST 5 mm 51,38% (42,05–60,60). La concordancia es mucho mayor entre Diaskintest e IGRA que entre cualquiera de ellas y la TST.",
      "lang": "es",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
